# The repository's single known owner is @draeician; no organizations, teams, or
# additional reviewers have been appointed yet. Ownership is therefore mapped to
# @draeician per bounded area so CODEOWNERS review requests route to a real,
# reachable account while workstreams remain conceptually separated (see
# docs/development/agent-workstreams.md). Update individual paths here only when
# real teams/owners are appointed — do not invent GitHub teams.

